{"content_hash": "09338fbb6e3a0cdd", "version_id": 1062, "article_id": 109, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Cozy planting game Green New Life launches on Steam on December 7", "title_zh": "温馨种植游戏《绿色新生活》于12月7日在Steam上线", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/222792", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1789370902773-b8dcdcf4b4ca?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8Y2FsbSUyMGdhbWUlMjBncmVlbnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk1NjY0NTcyfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by panpan ma on Unsplash", "author": "panpan ma", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@mymphoebe?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-relaxing-in-mengyang-park-O8VETz13QlA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(180, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(218, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "dd7cc7a7ba8d"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-26", "word_count": 124, "reading_minutes": 0.6, "lead": "A new cozy game about healing the world is coming soon. Players can grow plants and meet friendly nature spirits. The game has already made many fans on Steam.", "lead_zh": "一款关于治愈世界的新温馨游戏即将推出。玩家可以种植植物，结识友善的自然精灵。这款游戏已经在Steam上收获了许多粉丝。", "preview": "Publisher Gamirror Games said the game comes from developer Positive Impact Games. In Green New Life, you plant seeds and watch them grow in", "preview_zh": "发行商Gamirror Games表示，这款游戏出自开发商Positive Impact Games。在《绿色新生活》中，你播下种子，看着它们长成大树。你还会遇见古老的精灵，和可爱的动物交朋友。干涸的土地重新变绿。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1045, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 42.475, "size_bytes": 255744, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 143, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@c391479e/content/data/versions/1062.json", "paragraphs": ["Publisher Gamirror Games said the game comes from developer Positive Impact Games. In Green New Life, you plant seeds and watch them grow into big trees. You also meet old spirits and make friends with cute animals. Dry land turns green again.", "The game is made for casual players. There is no timer and no rush. You can fix the land slowly, at your own speed. Soft music and nature sounds, like wind and rain, go with your journey. The game also uses old folk stories.", "A free demo came out in October. It has a very good score on Steam, with 89% positive reviews. More than 50,000 people have put the game on their Steam wishlist. The full game launches on December 7."], "paragraphs_zh": ["发行商Gamirror Games表示，这款游戏出自开发商Positive Impact Games。在《绿色新生活》中，你播下种子，看着它们长成大树。你还会遇见古老的精灵，和可爱的动物交朋友。干涸的土地重新变绿。", "这款游戏是为休闲玩家打造的。没有计时器，也没有催促。你可以按照自己的节奏，慢慢修复土地。轻柔的音乐和风声、雨声等自然之声伴随你的旅程。游戏还融入了古老的民间故事。", "免费试玩版于十月推出。它在Steam上评分很好，89%的好评。超过50,000人已将这款游戏加入Steam愿望单。完整游戏于12月7日上线。"], "body": "Publisher Gamirror Games said the game comes from developer Positive Impact Games. In Green New Life, you plant seeds and watch them grow into big trees. You also meet old spirits and make friends with cute animals. Dry land turns green again.\n\nThe game is made for casual players. There is no timer and no rush. You can fix the land slowly, at your own speed. Soft music and nature sounds, like wind and rain, go with your journey. The game also uses old folk stories.\n\nA free demo came out in October. It has a very good score on Steam, with 89% positive reviews. More than 50,000 people have put the game on their Steam wishlist. The full game launches on December 7.", "body_zh": "发行商Gamirror Games表示，这款游戏出自开发商Positive Impact Games。在《绿色新生活》中，你播下种子，看着它们长成大树。你还会遇见古老的精灵，和可爱的动物交朋友。干涸的土地重新变绿。\n\n这款游戏是为休闲玩家打造的。没有计时器，也没有催促。你可以按照自己的节奏，慢慢修复土地。轻柔的音乐和风声、雨声等自然之声伴随你的旅程。游戏还融入了古老的民间故事。\n\n免费试玩版于十月推出。它在Steam上评分很好，89%的好评。超过50,000人已将这款游戏加入Steam愿望单。完整游戏于12月7日上线。", "text": "Publisher Gamirror Games said the game comes from developer Positive Impact Games. In Green New Life, you plant seeds and watch them grow into big trees. You also meet old spirits and make friends with cute animals. Dry land turns green again. The game is made for casual players. There is no timer and no rush. You can fix the land slowly, at your own speed. Soft music and nature sounds, like wind and rain, go with your journey. The game also uses old folk stories. A free demo came out in October. It has a very good score on Steam, with 89% positive reviews. More than 50,000 people have put the game on their Steam wishlist. The full game launches on December 7.", "vocab": [{"word": "cozy", "pos": "adj", "zh": "温馨舒适的", "note": "常用来形容轻松温暖的游戏或环境", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "publisher", "pos": "noun", "zh": "发行商", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "developer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "开发商", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "seed", "pos": "noun", "zh": "种子", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "spirit", "pos": "noun", "zh": "精灵；灵魂", "note": "这里指自然精灵", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "casual", "pos": "adj", "zh": "休闲的", "note": "casual player 指休闲玩家", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "demo", "pos": "noun", "zh": "试玩版", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "wishlist", "pos": "noun", "zh": "愿望单", "note": "Steam 上收藏想买的游戏列表", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-26T03:42:27.570696", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Publisher", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.725, "sm": 250, "em": 725, "cs": 0, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Gamirror", "s": 0.725, "e": 1.175, "sm": 725, "em": 1175, "cs": 10, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Games", "s": 1.175, "e": 1.525, "sm": 1175, "em": 1524, "cs": 19, "ce": 24, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "said", "s": 1.525, "e": 1.662, "sm": 1525, "em": 1662, "cs": 25, "ce": 29, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "the", "s": 1.663, "e": 1.75, "sm": 1662, "em": 1749, "cs": 30, "